But if you go to the browser at [http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/foo](http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/foo), you will see a nice HTTP error of:

```JSON
{
  "detail": [
    {
      "type": "int_parsing",
      "loc": [
        "path",
        "item_id"
      ],
      "msg": "Input should be a valid integer, unable to parse string as an integer",
      "input": "foo"
